.TH "CPS-IMAGE-CREATE" 1 "" "CPS" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
\&cps\-image\-create \- \&Initialize an empty directory as an image
.SH SYNOPSIS
.HP 4
.B \&cps image\-create [OPTIONS] \-\-root <ROOT>
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
.B \&\-\-root <ROOT>
.PP
.B \&\-\-config <CONFIG>
.TP
.B \&\-\-lock <LOCK>
\&Initialize with the publisher layout and bootstrap catalog of this lock
.TP
.B \&\-\-bundle <BUNDLE>
\&Initialize from a portable image bundle using locally configured trust
.TP
.B \&\-\-bootstrap\-catalog <BOOTSTRAP_CATALOG>
\&Bootstrap the configured release profile from this exact signed catalog
.TP
.B \&\-\-primary\-repo <PRIMARY_REPO>
\&Use this primary repository when bootstrapping a pinned release profile
.PP
.B \&\-\-repo <REPO>
.PP
.B \&\-\-publisher <PUBLISHER>
.PP
.B \&\-\-trust\-root <TRUST_ROOT>
.PP
.B \&\-\-arch <ARCH>
.TP
.B \&\-\-facet <[PACKAGE:]FACET=BOOL>
\&Set an image\-wide facet rule (FACET, PREFIX.*, or *) or a per\-package rule (PACKAGE:FACET, where PACKAGE may end in /*)
.TP
.B \&\-\-with\-dependencies
\&Apply the per\-package \-\-facet rules to each package's installed dependencies too
.TP
.B \&\-\-variant <NAME=VALUE>
\&Set a variant other than arch, such as container=true
.TP
.B \&\-h, \-\-help
\&Print help
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR cps (1)
